### Phase 6 — Indexed Search, Structured Request Logging & Production Probes
### Click "Send Request" (VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP Client)
### Start server: .\run.bat   |   Run pytest suite: .\test.bat

@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8080

### 1. Production Health Probe (check X-Request-Id response header + server access log)
GET {{baseUrl}}/@@api-health
X-Request-Id: demo-health-001
Accept: application/json

### 2. Fast Indexed Search by Department + Skill (B-Tree intersection, O(log N))
GET {{baseUrl}}/@@api-employees?dept=Engineering&skill=MySQL
X-Request-Id: demo-search-002
Accept: application/json

### 3. Fast Indexed Search by Skill Only
GET {{baseUrl}}/@@api-employees?skill=Zope
Accept: application/json

### 4. Create & Auto-Index New Employee
POST {{baseUrl}}/@@api-employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "empCode": "EMP-0010",
  "nameEn": "Kaito Mori",
  "nameJa": "森 海斗",
  "departmentEn": "Engineering",
  "departmentJa": "開発部",
  "role": "SRE",
  "skills": ["Nginx", "Gunicorn", "MySQL"]
}

### 5. Search Newly Indexed Skill Immediately
GET {{baseUrl}}/@@api-employees?skill=Nginx
Accept: application/json

### 6. 404 Not Found with X-Request-Id
GET {{baseUrl}}/@@api-employees/EMP-9999
X-Request-Id: demo-404-003
Accept: application/json
